{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_9_level_main_09-16_end","groupId":"main_9","stageId":"main_09-16","title":"“破晓”","storyCode":"9-18","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_09-16_end.txt","sourceHash":"27c30751ad6c62e547689d32bff95a7c4bebcd79ba3e05f323c39da25671f52d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G6_decisivebattlealley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"有人说，你在附近看见一个头上长角的白发姑娘了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏缩的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，我也不知道我见到的是不是你们要找的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"先说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏缩的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"她是不是受了重伤？胸口和肚子这一片，开了个好大的口子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"说下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏缩的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"她被一个灰头发的萨科塔抱着，血淌了一地，那叫一个惨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"萨科塔？你确定没看错？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏缩的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，我保证没看错。在小丘郡，萨科塔可不算常见，要不是她头上那个圆圆的灯管亮得吓人，大晚上的我都注意不到呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"他们去了哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏缩的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"就最后那屋子的楼上，破了窗的那间，刚刚那萨科塔跑得飞快，一下就蹿了进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"就那里？这么近？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"P8，R3，这里是B9——你们搞什么呢？！目标就在这个区！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"一小时前和半小时前，你们队就该搜过这条街上的每一间屋子了，为什么一直没汇报？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"什么玩意儿？一点声音都没有！P8，R3，立刻回复！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"*维多利亚粗口*！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏缩的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，还有我什么事吗？没什么事的话我就走了，那个，还有您答应能给我的一点点绷带......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"绷带？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你怕是用不上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏缩的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"您......您这是要做什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"这都是头领的命令。要怪，就怪你自己看到了不该看的东西——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏缩的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在流行打仗之前还要问名字的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏缩的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......哇......就差一点......我的脑袋就要掉了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你快走吧，我会帮你把这些坏家伙打跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏缩的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"谢、谢谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用谢，这是我们应该做的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"破城矛......是维多利亚士兵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"快，通知“强盗”长官，这里还有残余的维多利亚部队！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“强盗”？你们鬼魂部队的人起名字品味都这么差的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚才好像还打趴了几个嘴里喊着“囚犯”老大的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你干掉了P8整支小队？你......一个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"可他们有三十个人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的对手可是维多利亚部队——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就我一个也一样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"列队！列队！在这里围住她，她只有一个人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么快就重新组织了阵型？还蛮职业的嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"保持阵线！压上去！注意互相支援！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人冲锋能力很强，不要和她一对一！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？想以人数取胜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别太小看——我的矛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"咿啊啊啊！怎么会？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"这瓦伊凡太厉害了，一矛能穿俩！让重装防御兵上，其他人回防，赶紧去通知头领——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"别跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"最后一个！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊——该死，怎么连重装护甲都顶不住？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"得撤，再不撤就来不及了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，怎么突然飞起来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偷了我们的蒸汽喷射装置？还是又一波来自其他国家的改装飞行装备？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些敌人的作战手法和最早出现的那批又不一样了。鬼魂部队到底是一支什么样的部队啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是三角铁能在这里就好了，我的矛很难打到这么高的位置哎——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒了！有弩手在？不，击倒敌人的不是弩弹，是......石头？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，的确不是弩手——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Outcast单手抱着昏迷不醒的病人，从街道旁边的空屋里走出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你帮了我吗？谢谢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不客气，事实上，你也帮了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说萨科塔都很擅长用铳，没想到扔石头也能这么准！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，抱歉，我的枪火有些惹眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也对，铳的声响太不寻常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的朋友是受伤了吗？她看起来很不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在中午被脏弹击中了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对不起，差一点我们就能阻止这场袭击了。把无辜者牵连进去，真的是一个很大的错误。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，现在说这些也晚了，我只想能救几个人是几个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些敌人是在找你们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到他们在一路追杀平民，虽然我急着赶路，但我还是没法放任不管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的恶行会得到清算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！刚才我听到敌人说，有两支小队失联，我只遇到了一支，另一支原来是你动的手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好厉害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也很不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，敌人并不只有几支小队。他们有一整支军队，而且从下午开始，越来越多敌人在涌进来。我们很难守住小丘郡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是本地人的话，还是带着你的朋友先离开这座城市吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼下巷子外面全是敌人，你们只能从后面走——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，全堵上了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城里的落石真是异常的多啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趁他们还没追来，我会先帮你们清理下挡住后面这条路的碎石——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不撤退？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还要穿过城区，去和我的队友会合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要穿过城区？当前满城都是你的敌人，大部分路也被残垣封住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好，我已经走了一半啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一个人，打他们这么多人，倒是一点都不害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"害怕吗？战场上，我还从没有怕过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我蛮担心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没见过......一座维多利亚的城市变成现在这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当林贡斯被维多利亚和它的同盟一起彻底撕成碎片的时候，那座曾是世界之都的巨型城市彻底沦为炼狱，景象远比眼前惨上百倍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，四皇会战的胜利在课本上有多辉煌，对高卢人来说就有多残忍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚过去的确做了很多过分的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当战火烧到自己家乡的时候，才能更真切地感觉到，原来这么疼啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多了，就剩下这些横倒的石柱——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来帮你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢！能推到一边就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，一根柱子倒下了，很容易就会砸到另一根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声嘀咕）也不知道未来会怎么样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不到最后一刻，没人知道维多利亚会走向何方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我满脑子都在想这些，害你抱着人还要帮我一起推柱子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一起推总能更快些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是哦，大家一起干的话，总还有机会，事情还是能往好的方向发展的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，老这么说真是奇奇怪怪的，说到底，没机会了又怎么样？事情一路变得越来越坏又怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"故乡变坏了就不是故乡了吗？用自己的双手让土地重新变得肥沃，这不是每个生活在这里的人都该做的事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......最后一根！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路终于清好啦——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（快，B9刚才发的信标就在这巷子里！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（后面被落石挡住了，但保险起见，派一小队绕后！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（其他人守在路口，别让人出来，长官们马上就到——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又有人来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，我来挡着，你和你的朋友快走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕很难走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们说的，下面再来的应该就是敌人的首领，没普通士兵那么好对付。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那岂不是更应该快走？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忘了说——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逃跑从来不是我的习惯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来，年轻的朋友，帮我个忙——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Outcast把怀里的病人推到了风笛手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸，为什么这么重？她真的也是瓦伊凡吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，说一位女士重可不是好习惯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼哈......呃......换作别人还真不一定抱得动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好，我还认识一位朋友，她也是瓦伊凡，并且和你一样，是很年轻又很坚韧的战士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请你把病人带到雕像东侧，交给我的朋友和同事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉他们，我很抱歉，有些事我没做到。他们知道下面该怎么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再多留一会，等几个人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辩家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"就在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，长官。呃，您和其他五位长官都来了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“会计”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"情报里说，他们只有三个人......其中还有一位重伤昏迷着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"那，随便哪位长官出动都绰绰有余了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“会计”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"两个人，干掉了三支小队，并且毫发无伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“会计”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想告诉我你们有多垃圾，还是眼前的任务不重要到禁得起再三失败？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不敢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“囚犯”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......对手真这么强？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辩家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"至少强到你都愿意醒过来的地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“会计”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"谨慎一些总没坏处，别忘了，除了身份不明的萨科塔和维多利亚士兵，她也在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“会计”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"被逼到极限的话，她能做到什么程度，你们心里有底？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“囚犯”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......我开始期待起来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G5_victoria_street_n_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人数量......还在增加！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，呼叫队长——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通讯器还是没信号......唉！我必须马上把这姑娘交出去......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦......你醒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没醒啊......但为什么突然挣扎了起来？是梦见什么可怕的事了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_I5"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_I5"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G5_victoria_street_n_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员碎纸机","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......快到时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员碎纸机","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人正在往对面聚集，我们不宜久留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再等等吧，碎纸机大哥，Outcast绝对不是不守时的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员碎纸机","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，那个方向！是不是有两个人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Outcast，我们在这！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Out——不，不是她，朝我们冲过来的人是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"风笛？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？原来那个很帅的萨科塔女士说的朋友是你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那正好，来来来，这位受重伤的姑娘应该也是你们的朋友吧？萨科塔女士让我把她带给你们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Outcast......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在哪里？！她是不是出了事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她和我分开的时候挺好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过她想跟你们道歉，说她有事答应了没做到，她还说你们“知道下面该怎么做”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她说这话的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明她自己说的，救人之前，要先保全自己！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为只有这样，才能救更多人，更......多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员碎纸机","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"简！你不能去找她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员碎纸机","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"女士说了，我们知道该怎么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我同意这位大哥说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你相信她吗？我只和她见了一面，但我信她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把这姑娘带出来的时候，一路上干倒了二十多个人，不好说有没有更多人在后头追着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"士兵们都没什么大不了的，可要是撞上了那个领头的术师......相信我，她的实力深不见底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，接好你们的朋友，然后赶紧走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_I8"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员碎纸机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......这光，怎么回事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是爆炸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，不可能，没有任何一种炸弹能在瞬间爆发出这么强烈的光亮，同时还能让我们完好无损地站在这里正常呼吸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这难道是源石技艺？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是，这样在短时间内迸发到极致的源石技艺，施术者也会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"火光......刺破了云层......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是不是......雨停了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这火光来自西边......是刚刚那个巷子口？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是方向不对劲，我甚至以为天亮了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......是的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天......亮了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"所有人都没有再开口。\n那道灼穿了天幕的火仍在不屈地燃烧着——\n仿佛在向头顶迟迟不退的黑暗宣泄着死的怒火，又仿佛在向地上相扶相依的人们诉说着生的绚烂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这真是我见过......最震撼的破晓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难怪，她会说太惹眼。哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员碎纸机","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"简......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......哈，我没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"碎纸机大哥，时间到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员碎纸机","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟奥利弗叔叔说，我们已经......接应到了人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——是一名重症感染者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
